<?xml version="1.0"?>
<ScenContainer xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xmlns:xsd="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema">
  <ScenTitle>DACEX-14, 2014</ScenTitle>
  <ScenDescription>&lt;BODY scroll=auto&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-US&gt;&lt;FONT face=Helvetica&gt;
&lt;P class=Cuerpo style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"&gt;&lt;B&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-US&gt;Date/Time:&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/B&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-US style="mso-bidi-font-weight: bold"&gt; 24th August, 2014/ 18:00Z&lt;?xml:namespace prefix = "o" ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office" /&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=Cuerpo style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"&gt;&lt;B&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-US&gt;Location: &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/B&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-US style="mso-bidi-font-weight: bold"&gt;Canary Island (Spain)&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=Cuerpo style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"&gt;&lt;B&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-US&gt;Playable Side: &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/B&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-US style="mso-bidi-font-weight: bold"&gt;Iberian Coalition&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=Cuerpo style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=Cuerpo style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-US&gt;&lt;FONT face=Helvetica&gt;Each year the Spanish &lt;I&gt;Ej&lt;/I&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;I&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Arial Unicode MS','sans-serif'"&gt;é&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-US&gt;&lt;FONT face=Helvetica&gt;rcito del Aire &lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/I&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-US&gt;&lt;FONT face=Helvetica&gt;(Air Force) organize a multinational air to air combat exercise in the Canary Island. In addition to the local fighter squadron based in the Islands and others Spanish squadrons deploying fighters and support assets, several allied and NATO air forces send different aircrafts. &lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=Cuerpo style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-US&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;FONT face=Helvetica&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=Cuerpo style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-US&gt;&lt;FONT face=Helvetica&gt;To get advantage of the deployment effort, during the transit days several air defense scenarios are run. This scenario is one of them and will test the new air to air refueling, BVR combat and radar ID functionalities introduced in CMANO. &lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=Cuerpo style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-US&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;FONT face=Helvetica&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=Cuerpo style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-US&gt;&lt;FONT face=Helvetica&gt;You will assume the role of the Joint Forces Air Component Commander (JFACC) of the Iberian Coalition and will have full authority over a complex combined air component to fulfill just one order: to gain air superiority over the Canary Island, are you up to the task? &lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=Cuerpo style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-US&gt;&lt;FONT face=Helvetica&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-US&gt;&lt;FONT face=Helvetica&gt;
&lt;P class=Cuerpo style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-US style="mso-bidi-font-weight: bold"&gt;Version&amp;nbsp;1&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=Cuerpo style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-US style="mso-bidi-font-weight: bold"&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Arial Unicode MS','sans-serif'; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-ascii-font-family: Helvetica"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-US style="mso-bidi-font-weight: bold"&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=Cuerpo style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-US style="mso-bidi-font-weight: bold"&gt;(Scenario by Jos&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Arial Unicode MS','sans-serif'; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-ascii-font-family: Helvetica"&gt;é&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-US style="mso-bidi-font-weight: bold"&gt; R. Garc&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Arial Unicode MS','sans-serif'; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold; mso-ascii-font-family: Helvetica"&gt;í&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-US style="mso-bidi-font-weight: bold"&gt;a Paniagua "Blas de Lezo", member of the CMANO PdL design Team, September 2014)&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=Cuerpo style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/BODY&gt;</ScenDescription>
